From: elliotttate <elliotttate@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Qualify vertex-copy skips against completed buffer contents
Upstream-Commit: 39dcacb2e72546bb41b6eaf25b73aa0382742381

Inactive candidate on canonical 0152-0162. O3/ASan correctness passed.
Serial workload reduces uploads, but continuous two-frame overlap saves
no bytes because outstanding reservations decline. Do not promote this
candidate on the strength of its serial-only result.

